  "model_notes": [
    "partial REP: after WorkLimit(RepIterationBudget) (1024 iterations) the pump finishes the instruction without an APIC check; hardware may accept the interrupt between iterations (RIP at the REP, partial RCX)",
    "first handler instruction of a boundary entry runs inside run_apic_quantum and cannot be STI/CLI/HLT/IRETQ; wake from HLT does not run a handler instruction",
    "STI profile (S4-27c) admits only NOP/STI/CLI inside the STI shadow",
    "CLI at IF=1 outside the STI shadow is unsupported (StartIfSet admits only sti): terminal Unsupported; the cli_hlt scenario runs at initial IF=0 and does not cover it",
    "SkipShadowCheck injection is shown by the accepted primitive refusing (ProfileRejected), not by a wrong frame",
    "plain run(1) on HLT is Unsupported, not Halted; Halted only for run on an already halted CPU, unreachable via the pump API",
    "DRY debt: Stage4UartIrqProbe (S4-24e) keeps its own run/step_waiting/step_running loop until S4-27i5"
  ],
